{
  "_comment": [
    "Test content for reviews, screenshots and Playwright regression tests; `wp osec content generate --dataset=<this file>` fills a clean site with it (see README.md).",
    "Dates are PHP DateTime modifiers relative to the anchor: Monday 00:00 (site timezone) of the week with 15 May of next year, unless --anchor pins it. A list is applied in order.",
    "end, exdates, rdates and override.start are relative to the event's start. A missing or null end makes an instant event.",
    "group: showcase (shown in the plugin directory screenshots) or edge (exists to break things; regression only)."
  ],
